    "content" : "1.外部灯光 外部灯光的作用主要是照明和信号表达，不同灯光的作用和特点如下："
  }, {
    "type" : "list",
    "pdfua_tag" : "L",
    "id" : 13,
    "level" : "2",
    "page number" : 104,
    "bounding box" : [ 111.0, 184.94, 504.719, 312.39 ],
    "numbering style" : "arabic numbers",
